        "language": "modern_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "针对横脉来确定穴（风水中认为气脉聚结、适宜安葬或营建的位置）。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
